: "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "`payments-worker` is rolled back to v3.3.0 and healthy in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with the error rate down from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n- **Rollback:** v3.4.0 \u2192 v3.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy. No change-manager approval was needed, since v3.3.0 had already been healthy in production.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001, SEV2, opened against `payments-worker`. It paged the on-call engineer.\n\nThe incident summary describes the v3.4.0 deploy as the cause. I didn't confirm that beyond the timing and the error rate, so the on-call should check v3.4.0 before it is redeployed.", "type": "text"}]}]}